# Healthcare: Claim intake triage

Load examples/business/data/claim_submission.txt as Claim Submission
Alias Claim Submission as Claim

Find patient id and save as patient_id
Find claim id and save as claim_id
Find ndc code and save as ndc_code
Find quantity and save as quantity

triage_status equals "ready"

If patient_id is missing
  triage_status equals "needs review"

If ndc_code is missing
  triage_status equals "needs review"

quantity must be at most 90

Route triage_status to claim_intake_queue
